    "title": "What fast food restaurants are open and closed on Easter?",
    "text": "NEWSWhat fast food restaurants are open and closed on Easter? McDonald's, Wendy's, moreGrace Tucker Lianna NormanCincinnati EnquirerApril 18, 2025Updated April 20, 2025, 12:05 a.m. ETEaster, a Christian holiday commemorating the resurrection of Jesus Christ, lands this Sunday, marking the end of the 40-day Lent season, a time of prayer, fasting and giving.Restaurants that already close on Sundays, such as Chick-Fil-A, are closed on Easter. But for those looking to celebrate the end of Lent with some fast food, there are plenty of other quick service and dine-in restaurants that stay open.",
